/*  DepositsLoansDashboard.jsx — root component                            */
/*  Purely presentational. Static data comes from `data`; all trend data   */
/*  comes from `trendSections` (/DS/dashboard/trend-data via trendApi.js). */
/*  - Demand/Time Deposits: bubble charts, most recent date only.         */
